QUERY NAME: qryUpdateTestCap
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW ImpTotal.TCCode, ImpTotal.workgroup, "VLAPort" AS Expr1, [tccode] & [workgroup] AS Expr2
FROM ImpTotal
GROUP BY ImpTotal.TCCode, ImpTotal.workgroup, [tccode] & [workgroup]
HAVING ((Not ImpTotal.TCCode="Not avail") AND (ImpTotal.workgroup Not Like "LT??"));

